; HF-D4 reproducer: parse_json does not charge the decoded value tree.
; Expected: the decoded structure counts toward --max-memory-bytes.
; Observed: 4.5 MB of '[{"a":[]},...]' decodes under an 8 MiB budget while the
; process reaches about 225 MiB RSS.
(cli_app
  (let (raw (read_stdin))
    (let (doc (parse_json Doc raw))
      (print "decoded elements" (list_len doc)))))
